# Cloudflare Pages redirects. First match wins.
#
# NOTE: there is deliberately NO `/*  /index.html  200` SPA fallback.
# Every route is prerendered to its own index.html by scripts/prerender.mjs,
# and a catch-all would shadow those files and serve the home page everywhere.
# Unmatched paths fall through to dist/404.html, which is also prerendered.

